# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */

/* allowProperties: only accent-color is allowed, ime-mode is still flagged */
a { accent-color: red; ime-mode: active; }

/* allowSelectors: only "has" is allowed, fullscreen is still flagged */
h1:has(+ h2) { margin: 0; }
h1:fullscreen { color: red; }

/* allowFunctions: only color-mix is allowed, paint is still flagged */
a { background-image: paint(checkerboard); }

/* allowMediaConditions: only scripting is allowed, inverted-colors is still flagged */
@media (inverted-colors: inverted) { a { color: red; } }

/* allowPropertyValues: only writing-mode:lr is allowed, tb is still flagged */
a { writing-mode: tb; }

```

